    "description": "'Na valla cricket match odipoyinapudu..⁣⁣⁣\nNa tho school bunk koti doriki poyinapudu..⁣⁣⁣\nVaadi school crush tho anna ani pilipichinapudu.. ⁣⁣⁣\nNa mata vini report card lo sign chesi, parents tho thannulu thinnapudu..⁣⁣⁣\nAll Indians are not my sister's ani school assembly mic lo vaaditho chepinchinapudu..⁣⁣⁣\nPedhaiyekodhi vaadu line yesukune ammailaki nenu propose chesinapudu..⁣⁣⁣\nBike Wheeling chestha ani vadni kindha padesinapudu..⁣⁣⁣\nCollege lo na thappu valla, kalisi suspend ayinapudu..⁣⁣⁣\nVere college class lo kurchkoni, dorkipoyi, watchman tho kotichukunapudu..⁣⁣⁣\nDabullekha dhaba lo vaadi bandi petti ochesinapudu..⁣⁣⁣\nExam lo vaadu teesukochina chit lu, naku paniki ochinapudu..⁣⁣⁣\nSupply lu enni sarlu rasina pass avanapudu..⁣⁣⁣\nNakanna mundhu vaadiki job radhu anappudu..⁣⁣⁣\nVaadi first night ayyina morning, door bayata review kosam ninchunapudu.⁣⁣'\n⁣⁣⁣\n'Seni grahalu anni okke chota kalusthai, vallane friends antaru. Aa list lo first untav ra nuvu daridruda' ani antu untaru naku telisina jeevitha rajashekar fans.⁣⁣⁣\n⁣⁣⁣\nNa jeeitham lo na ex degara nunchi I love you ani enni sarlu vinano telidhu kani, ila na friends degara nunchi rojuku oka sari aina vinta, school nunchi following ala undedhi. ⁣⁣⁣\n⁣⁣⁣\nP.S 1. Ikada Vaadu ante na friends, bahuvachanam.⁣⁣⁣\nP.S 2: Vaadu ante oka abbai le kadhu. Ammai lu bochudumandhi unaru.⁣⁣⁣\nP.S 3: Nee life lo ilanti goppa friends untaru. Tag cheyakapoyina, forward chey.\n#fakemuchatlu",
